<para id="fs-id2646470">Before you get started, take this readiness quiz.</para>
<exercise id="fs-idm207409024">
<problem id="fs-idm215457168">
<para id="fs-idm214637312">What is the number modeled by the <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>base-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> blocks?<newline />
<media id="fs-id2778433" alt="An image consisting of three items. The first item is two squares of 100 blocks each, 10 blocks wide and 10 blocks tall. The second item is one horizontal rod containing 10 blocks. The third item is 5 individual blocks.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001_img.jpg" />
</media><newline />
If you missed this problem, review <link target-id="fs-id2222880" document="m81243" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm219309424">
<para id="fs-idm216142416"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
